<title>THAILAND: Trading in Thai Financial shares resumed.</title>
<headline>Trading in Thai Financial shares resumed.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai stock exchange on Friday allowed trading in Thai Financial Trust Plc to resume after the finance firm denied a local news report that a major shareholder had sold his stake in the company.</p>
<p>In a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand, Thai Financial Trust said the shareholder, Piyapong Kanikanan, had not sold any of his 13.88 percent holding in the company.</p>
<p>Trading in Thai Financial was halted earlier on Friday as the bourse said it awaited a disclosure from the company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
